# Paymaster/bundler support
# Set `BUNDLER_URL` or `PIMLICO_BUNDLER_URL` in the Supabase environment if
# you want ERC‑4337 transactions routed through a paymaster contract.  The
# backend will automatically pick the first address from the PAYMASTERS list.
# No private key is required for the paymaster itself.
#
# Example for local development:
#
# BUNDLER_URL=https://your-local-bundler.test/relay
#
# You can run your own bundler by copying and customizing
# `supabase/functions/gasless-relay/index.ts` to accept & forward
# `paymasterAddress` as shown in the project.
#
# If you don't set anything, the backend will automatically use Pimlico's
# public endpoint: `https://bundler.pimlico.io/relay`.

